OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will start dry
OL,6,Fwith bright spells and it will feel
OL,7,Fvery warm and humid. Areas of thicker
OL,8,Fcloud are likely to develop in the
OL,9,Fwest and through the Bristol Channel
OL,10,Fthough allowing some patchy rain to
OL,11,Fdevelop.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe western half of the
OL,14,Fregion is likely to have a cloudy
OL,15,Fevening and night with the chance of
OL,16,Fsome showers. Further east it looks
OL,17,Fdrier with occasional clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
