OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FThere will be a fair amount
OL,6,Fof cloud around on Tuesday, with a
OL,7,Fscattering of showers likely, these
OL,8,Flocally perhaps heavy. Not quite as
OL,9,Fwarm or humid as on Monday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCooler
OL,12,Fand rather breezy on Wednesday with a
OL,13,Ffew more showers possible. A drier and
OL,14,Fless breezy end to the week with some
OL,15,Fsunshine, though feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
